<XDFFORMAT version="1.70">
  <XDFHEADER>
    <flags>0x3</flags>
    <description>Suzuki Hayabusa Gen 3 (2022+, ECM 32990-10L series) calibration XDF for the Renesas RH850/E1L (R7F701201) ECU. Table descriptions were added based on title/axis analysis and general Suzuki ride-by-wire ECU architecture knowledge (TPS/IAP dual fuel tables, mode A/B/C + User ride modes, dual electronic throttle valves) -- treat descriptions for the unlabeled ETV correction curves and disable flags as working hypotheses to be confirmed against real datalogs, not verified fact.</description>
    <modifypassword>&#180;&#232;&#202;&#211;&#203;&#180;&#192;&#185; &#192;&#210;&#180;&#199;&#161;&#203;  &#192; &#192;&#202; &#192; &#192;&#185; &#192;&#192;&#181;&#168;-&#180;&#211;&#185;&#180;&#161;  &#168;&#162;  &#164;&#168;&#162;/&#229;&#164; &#168;&#162;/&#229;-&#181;&#192;&#168;&#162;-  &#168;-</modifypassword>
