  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x0" flags="0x0">
    <title>TPS - Mode A | Gear 1</title>
    <description>Primary fuel table (injector pulse width) indexed by throttle position (% TPS) and RPM, active in gear 1 while ride mode A (Suzuki Drive Mode Selector) is selected. This is a main tuning surface -- the mode split (A/B/C/User) is how Suzuki gives each ride mode its own power delivery character, and the per-gear split lets fueling be tightened or richened differently gear-to-gear (e.g. leaner/safer in low gears, more aggressive in top gear).</description>
