    <title>IAP - Neutral/Clutch-In | Cyl 1</title>
    <description>Secondary/blend fuel table for cylinder 1, indexed by Intake Air Pressure (IAP, i.e. manifold pressure -- a speed-density load signal) and RPM, active only in neutral or with the clutch pulled in. Runs alongside the TPS-based table for the same condition; the ECU likely blends or selects between TPS-based and IAP-based fueling depending on how fast the throttle is moving vs. how loaded the engine actually is.</description>
