    <description>Secondary/blend fuel table for cylinder 2, indexed by Intake Air Pressure (IAP, i.e. manifold pressure -- a speed-density load signal) and RPM, active only in neutral or with the clutch pulled in. Runs alongside the TPS-based table for the same condition; the ECU likely blends or selects between TPS-based and IAP-based fueling depending on how fast the throttle is moving vs. how loaded the engine actually is.</description>
    <CATEGORYMEM index="0" category="2" />
    <CATEGORYMEM index="1" category="4" />
    <CATEGORYMEM index="2" category="6" />
    <XDFAXIS id="x" uniqueid="0x0">
