  <XDFPATCH uniqueid="0x3B44">
    <title>Disable - Stock O2 Sensor</title>
    <description>[Binary patch entry, not a value table -- toggles fixed bytes at a fixed address.] On/off switch to disable ECU monitoring of the Stock O2 Sensor. Setting this suppresses the associated fault code / limp-mode behavior when that sensor or subsystem's hardware has been removed or modified (e.g. deleting PAIR/EVAP emissions hardware, removing the stock O2 sensor for an aftermarket exhaust). Leaving real subsystems disabled that are still physically connected can mask genuine faults -- use only for hardware you've actually removed.</description>
